flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Initialize arrays and recordCount = 0]
    B --> C[Display main menu]
    C --> D[/Read menu choice/]
    D --> E{Choice}
    E -- 1 Register --> F[Validate and store patient record]
    E -- 2 Search --> G[FindPatientIndex by Patient ID]
    E -- 3 Update --> H[Find ID and append diagnosis or treatment]
    E -- 4 Exit --> I[Print successful closure]
    E -- Other --> J[Print invalid selection]
    F --> K{System still running?}
    G --> K
    H --> K
    J --> K
    K -- Yes --> C
    K -- No --> L([End])
    I --> L
